WEBVTT

00:00:00.918 --> 00:00:03.169
Open the Server view of the account.

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.995
Bulk Email Operations lists the years.

00:00:04.995 --> 00:00:06.795
Pick a year and see how many emails it selects.

00:00:06.795 --> 00:00:09.182
Choose the action.

00:00:09.182 --> 00:00:12.269
The option explains what it will do before you start.

00:00:12.269 --> 00:00:13.009
Read the confirmation, then confirm.

00:00:13.009 --> 00:00:20.009
Progress runs in the corner of the window. The wait is shortened here.

00:00:20.009 --> 00:00:23.423
Operation Complete, and the Server count drops.

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:25.233
The Vault view still holds the archived emails.
